  "title": "Flutterwave Enables its Online Merchants in Nigeria to Accept American Express Payments",
  "summary": "Lagos, Nigeria, 20th August 2024: Flutterwave, Africa’s leading payments technology company, has announced today that its online merchants in Nigeria can now accept American Express payments. American Express Card Members – with consumer, business, or corporate cards – will be able to make payments directly to e-commerce businesses using Flutterwave in Nigeria. This service will […]",
